<title>UK: Bankgesellschaft sets 250 bln lire bond.</title>
<headline>Bankgesellschaft sets 250 bln lire bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Cariplo and IMI Luxembourg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BGB FINANCE IRELAND PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BANKGESELLSCHAFT BERLIN GROUP</p>
<p> AMT    250 BLN LIRE  COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    20.NOV.98</p>
<p> TYPE   ZERO-COUPON   ISS PRICE  88.725    PAY DATE    20.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (M) 5-50 SALE LIMITS US/UK/IT/IR/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
